.TH FL-MIXER 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-mixer \- PipeWire volume mixer
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-mixer\fR [\fB\-\-tab\fR \fIplayback\fR|\fIrecording\fR|\fIoutputs\fR|\fIinputs\fR|\fIconfiguration\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A volume mixer for PipeWire. \fBPlayback\fR and \fBRecording\fR list the
application streams with their volume, mute and device; \fBOutput Devices\fR
and \fBInput Devices\fR set the volume, balance, port and the default device;
\fBConfiguration\fR selects the profile of each sound card. Level meters show
the signal of every stream and device.
.PP
The volume button of \fBfl-panel\fR(1) and the Sound page of
\fBfl-settings\fR(1) use the same PipeWire connection code.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-tab\fR \fIname\fR
Open this tab.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwpctl\fR(1), \fBfl-panel\fR(1), \fBfl-settings\fR(1)
